{"id":"incendie","lemma":"incendie","pos":"noun","rank":1631,"glosses":["fire (something on fire which is out of control)"],"ipa":"/ɛ̃.sɑ̃.di/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/50/Fr-incendie.ogg/Fr-incendie.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"incendies"},"formAudio":{"incendies":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bb/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-incendies.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"L'incendie est sous contrôle.","en":"The fire is under control.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"below, under"},{"g":"control"}]},{"text":"Nous avons tout perdu dans l'incendie.","en":"We lost everything in the fire.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"lost"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"La maison est assurée contre les incendies.","en":"The house is insured against fire.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"house, home"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"insured","l":"assuré"},{"g":"against"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Où étiez-vous au moment de l'incendie ?","en":"Where were you at the time of the fire?","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"moment"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Avez-vous une assurance contre l'incendie ?","en":"Do you have fire insurance?","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"self-confidence"},{"g":"against"},{"g":"the / it"},null]}]}